(4. Software Testing Strategies \(LU III / CO3\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 695 Td
(Comprehensive software verification requires both black-box and white-box methodologies:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 679 Td
(" Equivalence Partitioning \(EP\): Splits inputs into valid and invalid classes \(e.g. Email format\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 663 Td
(" Boundary Value Analysis \(BVA\): Tests limit edges \(e.g. Max upload constraint at exactly 50 MB\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 647 Td
(" Control Flow Graph \(CFG\): Maps executable branch predicates into nodes and edges.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 631 Td
(" Cyclomatic Complexity: V\(G\) = E - N + 2P dictates the basis set of independent test paths.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
0.15 0.2 0.35 rg
50 601 Td
(5. Software Quality Assurance & Metrics \(LU IV & V\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 581 Td
(Statistical SQA quantifies process health using formal mathematical indicators:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 565 Td
(" Test Pass Rate \(TPR\) = \(Tests Passed / Total Tests Executed\) * 100.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 549 Td
(" Defect Removal Efficiency \(DRE\) = [Pre-Release Defects / \(Pre + Post Defects\)] * 100.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 533 Td
(" COCOMO II Effort Estimation: Effort = A * \(Size\)^B * ProdProduct\(EM\) in Person-Months.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.2 rg
50 517 Td
